//! name: consumer-count-drops-items-accepted
//! rule: 09.R43
//! expect: check-ok
//! detail: R35 -- a consumer's `for x in self` drops each item, which `Item: Droppable` (R21) licenses even for a non-`Copyable`, non-linear item

needs { };

struct Item { n: i32 }

fn f[I: Iterator](sink it: I) -> usize {
    return it.count();
}
